T-Deck Hybrid Phone firmware
Combined work licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later (see COPYING).

This firmware combines:

- meshpunk (MIT) — https://github.com/PhilMo6/meshpunk (fork of
  meshpunk/gui). LVGL/luavgl launcher + MeshCore integration for the
  LilyGO T-Deck. Original license headers retained.
- MeshCore (MIT) — https://github.com/meshcore-dev/MeshCore
  (git submodule at lib/MeshCore).
- pyxis (GPL-3.0) — https://github.com/torlando-tech/pyxis. Source of
  the embedded Reticulum/LXMF/LXST core: lib/pyxis_core/ (reimplemented
  service + vendored TCPClientInterface/HDLC), lib/auto_interface/,
  lib/microreticulum-shim/, lib/libbz2/ (bzip2, BSD-style license, via
  pyxis), and the patch_*.py build scripts. Per-file provenance is
  cited in headers/comments.
- microReticulum (MIT) — https://github.com/attermann/microReticulum
  via the pinned fork https://github.com/torlando-tech/microReticulum.
- microLXMF — https://github.com/torlando-tech/microLXMF (pinned).
- microStore — https://github.com/attermann/microStore (pinned).
- LVGL, luavgl, Lua, and the other vendored libraries under lib/ retain
  their respective upstream licenses.

MIT-licensed components are incorporated into the GPL-3.0 combined work
under the one-way compatibility of the MIT license; their original
copyright notices and license texts are preserved in place.
